}

EDreamPixelSortInterval.Waves {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamPixelSort.h#EDreamPixelSortInterval:Waves
    src   "Runs of near-uniform length, IntervalLength, lightly jittered per line. Ignores the image."
    text  "长度近乎均匀的区段，即 IntervalLength，每行轻微抖动。忽略图像。"
